# Quality / Husky

Canonical: `.agents/rules/quality.md`

## Hard rules

- Never skip Husky: no `--no-verify` / hook bypass.
- If pre-commit fails, fix ESLint/Prettier (or the reported error) and retry — do not bypass.
- Prefer validating before commit with `bun run check` (typecheck + lint + format:check).
- App work is not done in a mergeable state if Husky would reject the staged files.

## What runs

Husky pre-commit → lint-staged: ESLint `--fix --max-warnings=0` + Prettier on staged app files (`.agents/**` skills excluded).
